<title>ESTONIA: NAITUSTE SUBSCRIPTION CERTS TO BE TRADED.</title>
<headline>NAITUSTE SUBSCRIPTION CERTS TO BE TRADED.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eesti Naituste's, an exhibition and fairs company, subscription certificates will be traded from Monday, the Tallinn Stock exchange said on Monday.</p>
<p>The subscription certificates will be traded in amounts greater than 100 and have a face value of 0.05 kroons, the statement said.</p>
<p>Until all 400 000 subscriptions certificates have been traded under a different name from Eesti Naituste the share capital increase cannot be entered into the business register, the statment added.</p>
<p>--David Mardiste, Tallinn newsroom +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
